# Generated Lab aggregate: one JSON entry per line, sorted by slug, so two
# branches adding entries touch two different lines and a union merge keeps
# both sides without a conflict (#4181). Union keeps lines, it never removes
# them, so a removal can leave a STALE aggregate that only
#   node docs/site/scripts/lab-manifest.mjs --check
# catches. That check must stay a required gate.
docs/site/lib/generated/lab-data.ts merge=union
